# SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-or-later
# A T46S: 480x272, no touch. The app is given the screen's own size and draws a board of
# smaller cells for it. A game started, paused, and run into the wall.
waitframe 5000
expect app
expectstate appsize 480x272
shot build/t46s-title.png
key ok
wait 1500
key down
wait 600
shot build/t46s-playing.png
key ok
wait 300
shot build/t46s-paused.png
key ok
wait 6000
shot build/t46s-over.png
key x
wait 300
key x
waitscreen launcher 3000
